    "summary": "Your EMPEROR’S CHILDREN and LEGIONS OF EXCESS units become empowered when they are 6″ or closer to a friendly unit of the other listed faction. Weapons on models in an empowered unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1]. If it already has that ability, an attack with it scores a Critical Hit on an unmodified 5+.",
